{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:29 2026-11-27 HKT</p><p>今(27日)早上9時25分，青衣路對開海域發生撞船意外，一艘往來上環與蛇口的客輪，駛至青衣油庫附近，據報撞向船塢設施，船上至少25人受傷，包括2名小童，其中5人較嚴重，但全部清醒，大批救援人員趕往現場營救，並將客船拖到友聯船廠，將傷者送上岸然後送院救治。</p><img alt=\"有傷者手臂包紮著繃帶。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c5483a4fe2c01b26ff9213216afbb4c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_44_2_.jpeg\" title=\"有傷者手臂包紮著繃帶。劉漢權攝\"/><p>有傷者手臂包紮著繃帶。劉漢權攝</p><img alt=\"船上大批救援人員。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92fd61367ac011e36879903ea5b4323f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_45_1_.jpeg\" title=\"船上大批救援人員。劉漢權攝\"/><p>船上大批救援人員。劉漢權攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1a3cfda4d228422093d8b353b22e887/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_45.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cc6a8e80fc3a6054c3c45ff33f4f546/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_43.jpeg\"/><p>現場所見，部分傷者手臂受傷，須包紮固定傷勢。有傷者傷勢輕微，可自行登上救護車。</p><img alt=\"有傷者可自行登上救護車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07b64570b7387a8e4e330ba4ec7dd88b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_11_16_20_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"有傷者自行登上救護車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d394a37de61ac283495ef439b4107d6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_11_16_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f46c8663746fe7ef9467b0505d891f5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_15.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0e09c174e6dcbf7f6773e73f93f0c1c9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批救援人員在船上。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5373074dea8e7e1e1f0fd69d534231c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_40_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"救援人員在船上處理傷者。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e27b9c5cd94fdec06325fc676673ea0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_23.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05c3aebeba91079308eb8f253d5b14cd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5aeb213a5d6d25d5b108bd33d853c159/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_32_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"大批救護車到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccf12ca0dc4967c6140d660c06304d46/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_58_46.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防出動輔助醫療裝備車。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e29b44ed4ff5c90d0b75771183ec5e43/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_23_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e965bd816915b258b13c15bb3560a708/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_26.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8842f829a6129f4f24baa49f580390ec/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b98af8c5ff685214b2c4f01a3e8ac89/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-27_at_10_18_25.jpeg\"/><p>涉事客輪為 「新迅隆貳號」，是深圳招商迅隆營運的高速雙體客輪，主要行走香港上環港澳碼頭至深圳蛇口郵輪中心航線。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:03:54.364242+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":17,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:29:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:31:25.940537+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:57:31.819148+00:00","content_hash":"66d01f4bf2cf3c8b5eee9075b0d3c38a653894dba19b224110ed7a7bbff746fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}